The implementation of S27: Round Results Component is complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

**Files Created:**
- `src/components/game/RoundResults.tsx` - Component showing round resolution results
- `src/components/game/RoundResults.test.tsx` - 11 tests covering all functionality

**Files Modified:**
- `src/components/game/CurrentRoundPanel.tsx` - Uses RoundResults in resolved phase
- `src/components/game/GameView.tsx` - Passes resolution data to CurrentRoundPanel

**Component Features:**
- Song reveal (title, artist, year) when round is resolved
- Turn player placement result (correct/incorrect) with visual indicator
- Card awards section showing players who received cards
- Betting results showing each bettor's position, status, and outcome
- Host controls: "Start Next Round" button
- Non-host waiting state
- Resolved timestamp display

